2. Tatoeba

The word lists in src/rules/words/ (used to find letter-spaced words, WCAG failure F32) are the
most frequent lower-case words in the sentences of Tatoeba (https://tatoeba.org), from its eng,
por and spa exports of 3 October 2026. They hold words and their selection, no sentence.
scripts/word-lists.py builds them again, and docs/rules.md records the exports used.

Tatoeba's sentences are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 2.0 France
(CC BY 2.0 FR, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/fr/); some are CC0.


