4. CMUdict

test/fixtures/coga/syllables-en.json holds 943 English words with their syllable counts from the
Carnegie Mellon University Pronouncing Dictionary (CMUdict, https://github.com/cmusphinx/cmudict,
commit 74790861f652), built by scripts/syllables-en-sample.py. A test measures Rampa's English
syllable heuristic against it. The words are a sample of the Tatoeba word list of section 2; the
counts come from CMUdict, whose license the file also copies:

